Lenta (RU),Russia,ru,В МИД раскрыли отношение России к Армении,The Foreign Ministry revealed Russia's attitude towards Armenia,"The Foreign Ministry revealed Russia's attitude towards Armenia Advertising Russia and Armenia have a special relationship and sincere love between the peoples of the two countries. Official representative of the Russian Foreign Ministry Maria Zakharov spoke about this in an interview with blogger Olga Blagoveshchenskaya. “For us, Armenia is not just a sovereign state, of course. A sovereign, independent state with ancient roots, with an amazing ancient culture, but it is also a state with which we have a special relationship,” she noted. According to the diplomat, the two countries are connected by peace, interstate relations and strategic plans for the development of these relations. Russia has always provided only help and support, Zakharova added. It was previously reported that Armenia plays the same role for Russia as the Strait of Hormuz does for Iran. This was stated by the former Prime Minister of the post-Soviet republic Khosrow Harout","Mon, 13 Jul 2026 03:46:00 +0300",https://lenta.ru/news/2026/07/13/rrrr/,2026-07-13 01:25:28
