Lenta (RU),Russia,ru,Посол заявил о поддержке Норвегией ядерных миссий НАТО,The Ambassador announced Norway's support for NATO nuclear missions,"The Ambassador announced Norway's support for NATO nuclear missions Advertising Norway has switched to supporting nuclear missions of the North Atlantic Alliance (NATO), Russia has a negative attitude towards this step. This was stated by Russian Ambassador to Oslo Nikolai Korchunov in a conversation with Izvestia. “The Russian side has a sharply negative attitude towards such interaction between the countries of the North Atlantic Alliance, viewing it as joint nuclear missions that undermine the NPT (Nuclear Non-Proliferation Treaty) regime, security in the Euro-Arctic region and global stability in a broader sense,” Korchunov said. Earlier, Ukrainian President Vladimir Zelensky accused Norway of making a false promise. According to him, Oslo initially expressed its readiness to pay for the supply of 200 missiles to Kiev, but none of them reached the Ukrainian side.","Mon, 13 Jul 2026 00:28:47 +0300",https://lenta.ru/news/2026/07/13/posol-zayavil-o-podderzhke-norvegiey-yadernyh-missiy-nato/,2026-07-13 01:26:25
