Lenta (RU),Russia,ru,Выжившие после иранской атаки военные США обвинили генералов в предательстве,US military survivors of Iranian attack accuse generals of treason,"US military survivors of Iranian attack accuse generals of treason Advertising The American military, which managed to survive an Iranian UAV strike on a US base in the Kuwaiti port of Al-Shuaiba, accused its generals of betrayal and ignoring warnings of a potential attack. This was reported by The Washington Post (WP), citing sources familiar with the internal investigation. The newspaper found out that as a result of the strike, which occurred on the second day of US participation in the conflict with Iran, six soldiers of the 103rd United States Army Logistics Command were killed and several dozen more were wounded. The attack was described as one of the deadliest for American troops during the conflict. The military interviewed by the publication said that the commanders ignored the intelligence data according to which the port of Al-Shuaiba was called ver.","Sun, 12 Jul 2026 23:58:00 +0300",https://lenta.ru/news/2026/07/12/vyzhivshie-posle-iranskoy-ataki-voennye-ssha-obvinili-generalov-v-predatelstve/,2026-07-13 01:26:33
Lenta (RU),Russia,ru,Стало известно об исключении патриарха Кирилла из санкционных списков ЕС,It became known about the exclusion of Patriarch Kirill from the EU sanctions lists,"It became known about the exclusion of Patriarch Kirill from the EU sanctions lists Advertisement The European Union (EU) excluded Patriarch Kirill of Moscow and All Rus' from the 21st package of sanctions. This was reported by the publication ""European Truth"" with reference to diplomatic sources. It is noted that the proposal to ban the import of cod and pollock will also be excluded from the sanctions package. In addition, the plan regarding restrictions on Russian liquefied gas will not be implemented, the publication writes. In February, Bulgaria presented three points to which it would object when forming a new package of EU anti-Russian sanctions. In particular, Sofia did not support the introduction of sanctions against Patriarch Kirill.","Sun, 12 Jul 2026 23:52:46 +0300",https://lenta.ru/news/2026/07/12/stalo-izvestno-ob-isklyuchenii-patriarha-kirilla-iz-sanktsionnyh-spiskov-es/,2026-07-13 01:26:35
