lp of Pakistani mediation, Tehran’s UN ambassador said ","Sat, 11 Jul 2026 22:51:11 +0530",https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/iran-us-war-donald-trump-washington-tehran-peace-talks-west-asia-conflict-strait-of-hormuz-live-updates-july-11-2026/article71209275.ece,2026-07-13 01:28:30
